# The prototyped Phyrexian Fleshgorger's ward (CR 702.21a): Bot2 does not pay the 3 life (its power as prototyped), so
# Unsummon is countered, Bot2 keeps its 20 life and the 3/3 stays on the battlefield, still prototyped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Phyrexian Fleshgorger
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Unsummon
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Fleshgorger.Cast(Ability: Prototype)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Fleshgorger)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Unsummon
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Fleshgorger.Prototyped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Fleshgorger.Power = 3
